:: Underground city - escaped slave - master [Place bg-underground]
<h1 class="ptitle">BAR</h1>
<br />
<<newguy>>
<<set $tmpGuy.name = either('Brek', 'Olar', 'Stet', 'Harv', 'Dune', 'Mace', 'Crog', 'Vane')>>
<center>
    <<image 'places/underground/underground_escaped_slave_master.jpg'>>
</center>
<br />
It didn't take long. You described her and the barman jerked his head toward a corner booth without a word. The man was three drinks in — broad, with a face that had gotten used to getting what it wanted. When you sat across from him something shifted in his expression.
<br /><br />
<<sayNpc $tmpGuy>>
    You found her.
<</sayNpc>>
<br />
He straightened up.
<br /><br />
<<sayNpc $tmpGuy>>
    Where is she? Bring her to me and there's caps in it.
<</sayNpc>>
<br />
<<set _reward = randomInteger(30, 50)>>
He slid <strong class="iitem"><<=_reward>> caps</strong> across the table. His eyes stayed flat.
<<set _canCapture = $slaves.length < $basementLimit>>
<div id="esm_handover">
<<linkreplace 'Hand her over'>>
    <<run $('#esm_keep').hide()>>
    <<run $('#esm_walk').hide()>>
    You told him where she was. He was already moving before you finished.
    <br /><br />
    You received <strong class="iitem"><<=_reward>> caps</strong>.
    <<set $player.money += _reward>>
    <<unset $tmpGirl>>
    <br /><br />
    <<link 'Leave'>>
        <<goto 'Underground city'>>
    <</link>>
<</linkreplace>>
</div>
<div id="esm_keep">
<<if _canCapture>>
<<linkreplace 'Keep her yourself'>>
    <<run $('#esm_handover').hide()>>
    <<run $('#esm_walk').hide()>>
    <<if $player.strength >= $tmpGuy.strength>>
        You pushed the caps back across the table. He read your face and decided it wasn't worth the trouble.
        <br /><br />
        <<sayNpc $tmpGuy>>
            Fine. She's yours. Not my problem anymore.
        <</sayNpc>>
        <br />
        He picked up his drink. The conversation was over.
        <br /><br />
        <<run $slaves.push($tmpGirl)>>
        <<statsAdd 'people_captured'>>
        <<unset $tmpGirl>>
        <br />
        <<link 'Leave'>>
            <<goto 'Underground city'>>
        <</link>>
    <<else>>
        He didn't move. Just looked at you like you'd said something stupid.
        <br /><br />
        <<sayNpc $tmpGuy>>
            That's my property. You want to make this a thing?
        <</sayNpc>>
        <br />
        Three men at the bar turned to look. You weren't carrying enough to make it worth it.
        <br /><br />
        <<unset $tmpGirl>>
        <<link 'Back down'>>
            <<goto 'Underground city'>>
        <</link>>
    <</if>>
<</linkreplace>>
<</if>>
</div>
<div id="esm_walk">
<<link 'Say nothing and walk away'>>
    <<unset $tmpGirl>>
    <<goto 'Underground city'>>
<</link>>
</div>
